  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maji Nyumbani - implementation phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maji Nyumbani- Pilot Phase</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will build capacities of 10 selected SACCOs with to provide water/sanitation financing solutions for both households and community-based water enterprises active in their locality. The SACCOs are serving both urban and rural communities through their branches located in different counties accross Kenya.- The 10 SACCOs will mobilize **KES 225 Million (EUR 1.76M)** towards lending to households and MSME clients (Leverage 1:7)- The program targets **2000 households** (200 per Sacco) and **250 MSME clients** (25 per Sacco)- 2,250 loans will be disbursed-  12,500 people will be reached (8,250 female)-  1250 jobs will be directly and indirectly created</narrative>
  </description>
